<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Lötschenpass: Lauchernalp–Selden — Lauchernalp – Lötschenpass – Selden</name><desc>Cross from Lauchernalp via Lötschenpasshütte and Lötschenpass to Gfelalp and Selden. The hard mountain route includes loose stones and a debris-covered glacier section; use dry, snow-free conditions and ask the hut about current passage.

